{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026yn8UiNZwtd1792995619.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>整體樓市表現靠穩，馬鞍山區二手交投平穩。美聯物業馬鞍山 – 天宇海分行高級營業經理陳德涪（Ken Chan）表示，該行最新促成海典灣一個495實呎兩房單位成交，獲用家以675萬元承接。<br/>陳德涪表示，成交單位為海典灣5座高層D室，實用面積約495平方呎，屬兩房間隔。單位原本叫價698萬元，最終以675萬元成交，折合實用呎價約13,636元。<br/>資料顯示，原業主於2020年10月以約763萬元購入上述物業，持貨約6年，帳面蝕讓約88萬元，貶值約11.5%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:42:37.883158+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":227,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T20:18:09.763382+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T09:38:47.727460+00:00","content_hash":"94f110fca22a81e1c4a77a5caeef0548e69e41536f2aecf82ab3ffa1740a64c3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:42:37.883158+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}